:
## Inherited from 2.7.2g: standalone colons must survive both numbering passes.
## Uppercase source isolates this case from the separate upper$ alias fix.
VALUE%=0
:
GO TO @AFTER
:
VALUE%=99
@AFTER
:
VALUE%=VALUE%+1
ADVANCE
:
OPEN_NEW #9,"win1_result"
:
PRINT #9,VALUE%
:
CLOSE #9
:
OPEN_NEW #9,"win1_done":PRINT #9,"OK":CLOSE #9
:
STOP
DEFINE PROCEDURE ADVANCE
:
 VALUE%=VALUE%+1
:
END DEFINE
:
